        "mode": "bash",
        "code": "# 检测eggbenchmark的污点链路，链路source/sink点配置：./Downloads/eggbenchmark.json\n./yasa-macos-arm64 --ruleConfigFile ./Downloads/eggbenchmark.json --analyzer EggAnalyzer --checkerPath ./src/checker/taint/js ./EggProject/eggbenchmark/\n\n# 获取 root.go文件的抽象语法树（AST）\n./yasa-macos-arm64 ./GoProject/cmd/root.go --language golang --uastSDKPath ./uast/uast4gomacosarm/uast4go-macos --dumpAST \n\n# 获取 ant-application-security-testing-benchmark 代码库的完整call graph\n./yasa-macos-arm64  ./ant-application-security-testing-benchmark --analyzer JavaAnalyzer -dumpAllCG",
